  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati Australia Health Sector Program (KAHSP) Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kiribati Australia Health Sector Program 2 supports the Kiribati Government to enhance its capacity to manage and deliver an effective and inclusive health system, control chronic conditions and prepare and respond to health security threats.
KAHSP delivery modality included: i) direct engagement with GoK through the Ministry of health and Medical Services; ii) procurement of health specialist services through the SHS Global; and iii) grants to international organisations such Interplast and Hepatitis B Free.
Australia&#x2019;s support is aligned with the priorities of the Kiribati Ministry of Health and Medical Services (MHMS) Strategic Plan 2024-2027.</narrative>
  </description>
